     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Constructed 64 small scale tourism infrastructure in collaboration with 29 R/Municipalities. Project created estimated 20,000-man days of short-term employment while construction of small-scale tourism infrastructure in collaboration with local government

Provided capacity building training to around 1287 tourism sector workforce; out of which 38% were women.

Prepared 6 tourism service standards and guidelines

1 national tourism recovery strategy developed.

Accomplished 7 province level domestic tourism strategic action plan preparation workshop</narrative>
      </comment>
