      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022;	Completion of 120 schemes including 30 small-scale tourism infrastructure

&#x2022;	Creation of Short term employment for 1600 vulnerable tourism sector workers

&#x2022;	Leverage 15 % co-financing from local government and private sector tourism association

&#x2022;	Development three strategy and guideless</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022;	Completed 124 Schemes including 36 small-scale tourism infrastructure

&#x2022;	Short term employment created for 5,645 vulnerable tourism sector workers and created 76,948 person-days of total employment. Out of 5645 tourism workers, 1442 (25.5%) women were provided 21,445 person-days of employment.

&#x2022;	Project leveraged 18% co-financing from local government and private sector tourism associations

&#x2022;	Project support to develop National Tourism Recovery Strategy document, and two tourism industry-level service standards for &#x201c;Food and Beverage Service Standards&#x201d; for Restaurant and Bars in coordination with REBAN, and &#x201c;Tourist Vehicle Operating Standards Guidelines&#x201d; in coordination with Nepal Tourist Vehicle Association (NTVA).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
